{
  "changelog": "- Initial release of geoskill-wetland-mapping.\n- Classifies wetlands by fusing NDWI/MNDWI, NDVI, DEM, and SAR backscatter (co-registered raster bands).\n- Rule-based decision tree outputs open water, swamp, mudflat, or non-wetland classes with priority water > swamp > mudflat.\n- Supports both local fused 4-band raster input and offline multi-source synthetic data (--synthetic).\n- Outputs wetland classification GeoTIFF, area statistics (JSON), and manifest (JSON, with QA in synthetic mode).\n- All processing is offline and local; no network or user data upload required.",
